{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02766","headline":"早度分水岭 · 卢照邻","name":"早度分水岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丁年游蜀道，班鬓向长安。\n徒费周王粟，空弹汉吏冠。\n马蹄穿欲尽，貂裘敝转寒。\n层冰横九折，积石凌七盘。\n重溪既下漱，峻峰亦上干。\n陇头闻戍鼓，岭外咽飞湍。\n瑟瑟松风急，苍苍山月团。\n传语後来者，斯路诚独难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}